d 'MODELAUDIT': module to provide diagnostics for comparing two or more stored estimation results
d
d  modelaudit is a diagnostic command for comparing two or more
d stored estimation results. It is designed to make model-to-model
d changes transparent by reporting estimation-sample
d characteristics, focal-estimate movement, model complexity,
d information criteria, and exact estimation-sample comparability. 
d
d KW: model comparison
d KW: estimation results
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.2
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261010
d
d Author:  Christina Laternser ,  Ann & Robert H. Lurie Children’s Hospital of Chicago
d Support: email christina.laternser.research@@gmail.com
d
f modelaudit.ado
f modelaudit.sthlp
f modelaudit_examples.do
f modelaudit_public_validation.do
